#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
CorkyTux Minecraft Launcher plugin.

Protocol: JSON Lines on stdout. One JSON object per line, streamed as
events happen (progress, done, error). Mirrors the pattern used by
dependency-installer / dll-overrides-automator, extended for streaming.

Auth flow: standard Microsoft Identity Platform "device code" grant
(publicly documented OAuth2 flow, RFC 8628) followed by the public
Xbox Live -> XSTS -> Minecraft Services token exchange documented at
https://wiki.vg/Microsoft_Authentication_Scheme. This is Microsoft's/
Mojang's own public API surface, independent of any specific launcher
codebase.

Download/install/launch: delegated to `minecraft-launcher-lib` (MIT
licensed, PyPI: minecraft-launcher-lib), which implements the public
Mojang piston-meta manifest format.
"""

